WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.290
The architect is at the opening
of a villa he just delivered.

2
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.570
He sends Rosalia three pictures.

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.220
Update the portfolio page and make
an Instagram post for Project Amanara.

4
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.150
She publishes the project
on the website.

5
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.100
Then the Instagram post.

6
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.880
She answers the first comments.

7
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.740
Back on WhatsApp, it's done.
